Package: poppkflow
Title: Structured Iterative Population PK Workflow with 'nlmixr2'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Rainer", "Strotmann", email = "rainer.strotmann@mailbox.org",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0543-7984"))
Description: Supports the data-driven, iterative process of population
    pharmacokinetic model development with 'nlmixr2'. Models are declarative
    specifications, every fit is registered in a run ledger (a flat table plus
    RDS files per run), and the tools for diagnostics, comparison with the
    parent run, decisions with rationale, covariate modelling, robustness
    checks, evaluation and reporting work on that ledger.
